if SHIELD_ESB_NAPE_TOUCHTEST

# Touch bring-up test variant layered on esb_nape_disptest: no
# Kconfig changes of its own. v4 mirrors the proven prospector-
# bridge recipe: the CST816T node moves from i2c0 (old node
# disabled) to &xiao_i2c (= i2c1, board-default pins SDA=P0.04 /
# SCL=P0.05) at 100 kHz with irq-gpios (D0) + rst-gpios (D1), the
# LVGL pointer input is repointed at the new node (all in
# esb_nape_touchtest.overlay), the driver runs in interrupt mode
# (esb_nape_touchtest.conf), and the dummy PAW3222 sensor + SPI1
# bus stay disabled with the dummy kscan parked on P1.03. The
# test app (hardware I2C scan cross-check + tap screen) is
# src/touch_test.c. Keyboard name etc. still come from esb_nape_rx.

endif
